<div class="modal-content">
  <button class="modal-close" @click="$refs.helpDialog.close()" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>

  <h2>Quick Reference</h2>

  <p>Please see our
    <a href="http://kanjialive.com/user-guide/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">User Guide</a> for detailed explanations of all of <em>Kanji alive's</em> features or watch our
    <a href="http://www.youtube.com/kanjialive/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">short demonstration videos</a>. If you are having technical difficulties, please refer to our
    <a href="http://kanjialive.com/troubleshooting" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Troubleshooting</a> page.
  </p>
  <p>詳細は、メーニューの「日本語」内にある使用説明とトラブルシューティングをご参照ください。</p>

  <h3>Navigation</h3>
  <table class="help-table">
    <tr>
      <td>Next/Previous kanji</td>
      <td>Use the <kbd>&larr;</kbd> and <kbd>&rarr;</kbd> keys or click on the left and right single pointed brackets in the top navigation bar</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Toggle kanji animation/typeface</td>
      <td>Use the <kbd>&uarr;</kbd> or <kbd>&darr;</kbd> keys or click on the large image of the kanji.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Next/Previous typeface</td>
      <td>Use the <kbd>Shift</kbd> + <kbd>&larr;</kbd> and <kbd>Shift</kbd> + <kbd>&rarr;</kbd> keys or click on the left and right single pointed brackets next to the name of the typeface</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Return to Search</td>
      <td>Click on the text of the current search term on the far left of the navigation bar</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <p>
    Note: The order in which kanji appear in the detail view when selecting the next or previous kanji is dependant on the sort mode previously chosen in the search view.
  </p>

  <h3>Other Interactive Elements</h3>
  <table class="help-table">
    <tr>
      <td>Play/Pause kanji animation</td>
      <td>Use the <kbd>spacebar</kbd> or click on the play/pause icon in the center of the kanji animation controls.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Next/Previous stroke</td>
      <td>Use the <kbd>Shift</kbd> + <kbd>&larr;</kbd> or <kbd>Shift</kbd> + <kbd>&rarr;</kbd> keys, click the previous and next stroke icons on each side of the play/pause icon or move your mouse cursor over the stroke breakdown images.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Radical animation</td>
      <td>Click on the image on the far right of the radical field to view an animation illustrating the radical's historical derivation.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Examples</td>
      <td>Move your mouse cursor over a Japanese word in the Examples field to reveal its English meaning. Click on the play icon to the right of each example to hear its pronunciation.</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>
